{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57193","headline":"十四科头 菩提烦恼不二 · 宝志","name":"十四科头 菩提烦恼不二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衆生不解修道，便欲断除烦恼。\n烦恼本来空寂，将道更欲覔道。\n一念之心即是，何须别处寻讨。\n大道晓在目前，迷倒愚人不了。\n佛性天真自然，亦无因缘修造。\n不识三毒虚假，妄执浮沈生老。\n昔时迷日爲晚，今日始觉非早。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57193.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57193","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}